# test/data

Ephemeris data files for the node integration tests
(test/ephe.test.js, test/eclipse.test.js).
These are the real Swiss Ephemeris .se1 files, downloaded once and cached
here so the tests run offline (seplm06/semom06 for the BCE tests,
sepl_18/semo_18 for the 2024-2025 eclipse census).

To (re)fetch:

    cd test/data
    for f in seplm06.se1 semom06.se1 sepl_18.se1 semo_18.se1; do
      curl -sS -L --retry 3 -o "$f" \
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aloistr/swisseph/master/ephe/$f"
    done

Not part of the deployed site and not included in the AGPL Corresponding
Source archive (build_source_zip.sh lists its files explicitly).
